{"id":"a400266e1814b901","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-levy.md","title":"Levy Collapse","display":"df-levy — Levy Collapse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-levy","aliases":["58-df-levy","Levy Collapse"],"display":"df-levy — Levy Collapse","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-levy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-levy</span><span>Levy Collapse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-levy — Levy Collapse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\)</span> (infinite cardinals, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> regular)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> (partial-function condition)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span> (function primitives, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)}\">\\(\\leq_{\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)}\\)</span> (collapse carrier and order defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Levy}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Levy}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> 为原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\)</span> 集合载体的兼容函数名，定义域与原函数完全一致。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\left\\{p:\\exists D\\subseteq[\\kappa,\\lambda)\\times\\kappa\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(p,D,\\lambda)\\land|D|&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall\\langle\\alpha,\\xi\\rangle\\in D\\;(p(\\langle\\alpha,\\xi\\rangle)&lt;\\alpha)\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\left\\{p:\\exists D\\subseteq[\\kappa,\\lambda)\\times\\kappa\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(p,D,\\lambda)\\land|D|&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall\\langle\\alpha,\\xi\\rangle\\in D\\;(p(\\langle\\alpha,\\xi\\rangle)&lt;\\alpha)\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}order} \\vdash p\\leq_{\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)}q\\leftrightarrow p,q\\in\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\land p\\supseteq q\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}order} \\vdash p\\leq_{\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)}q\\leftrightarrow p,q\\in\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\land p\\supseteq q\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}carrier\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\n\\to\\mathrm{Levy}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}carrier\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\n\\to\\mathrm{Levy}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the standard reverse-inclusion presentation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>It collapses cardinals in the interval <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\([\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> to size at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; it does not collapse all cardinals above <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Additional hypotheses on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> are needed for conclusions such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=\\kappa^+\">\\(\\lambda=\\kappa^+\\)</span> in the extension.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ and $\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]] and [[58-df-regular-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":